.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/last-day-2013-06-03","license":null,"text":"\"Last Day\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jun 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-last-day-2013-06-03-e12","era":null,"summary":"Liric's father does not recognize him and sits back down before the wall.","participants":["liric","liric-s-father"],"location":"ismeri","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-last-day-2013-06-03","order":397,"story_date":"2013-06-03","storyline":"Ravnica: City of Guilds","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":43,"quote":"\"I'm sorry agent... I've forgotten your name. Did you come to make a deposit?\"","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160312043336/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/last-day-2013-06-03#:~:text=%22I%27m%20sorry%20agent...%20I%27ve,to%20make%20a%20deposit%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Last Day","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-06-03","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/last-day-2013-06-03","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160312043336/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/last-day-2013-06-03#:~:text=%22I%27m%20sorry%20agent...%20I%27ve,to%20make%20a%20deposit%3F%22","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160312043336/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/last-day-2013-06-03","license":null,"text":"\"Last Day\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jun 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-last-day-2013-06-03-e13","era":null,"summary":"Liric unravels his strand in an alley, resolving to bury it in the school garden and live as a schoolteacher.","participants":["liric","strand"],"location":"ismeri","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-last-day-2013-06-03","order":397,"story_date":"2013-06-03","story